  "ruleText": "CHAPTER Res 5200 RULES FOR THE OPERATION OF WOOD PROCESSING MILLS AND WOOD CONCENTRATION YARDS\n\nStatutory Authority: RSA 227-G:4, II\n\nREVISION NOTE:\n\nDocument #6207, effective 3-21-96 repealed Chapter Res-F. Document #6207 supersedes all prior filings for the sections in Chapter Res-F 300. The prior filings for the former Chapter Res-F 300 include the following documents:\n\n#2221, eff 12-23-82\n\n#2979, eff 2-21-85 EXPIRED 2-21-91\n\n#5619, eff 4-28-93",
